        <div class="arrangement" data-arrangement tabindex="0" aria-label="${Y(`Arranger. Las flechas mueven clips; Ctrl+D duplica; Supr borra; Escape cancela el arrastre.`,`Arranger. Arrow keys move clips; Ctrl+D duplicates; Delete removes; Escape cancels drag.`)}"></div>

